    },
    {
      "text": "The future doesn't wait. Neither should you.",
      "file": "1798c0a882e36c4369200370c9283d8f1c2d5f809570bc907cdd563d3cd61b70.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Welcome to the movement.",
